v4.0.1 — 2026-10-13

Smoother reading: the story map on the left card is built after the extracted card settles when a story opens,
and in the next idle period after a chapter change, so it no longer shares a frame with the new text (worst frame
on open 100-112 ms -> 76-82 ms, chapter change 58-82 -> 41 ms, back 17-41 -> 12 ms on an RTX 5070 Laptop).
Reader checks now include cross-story reading-context consistency.

v4.0.0 — 2026-10-13

Stellaris Tales V4: story trees for every story in the local Stellaris installation (base game and installed DLC
files). 1,390 reviewed stories in eight categories (acceptance evidence in content/chronology/REVIEW.md), 8,670
original bilingual documents, event inheritance resolved, a source-grounded guide per story, GPU archive scene and
Detroit-style flow map. Changing this file on main publishes the site (see docs/RUNBOOK.md, "Release").
